[{"id": 39769000, "text": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">I spy with my little eye something <b>under</b> something beginning with <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">T</span>.\n<br /><i>The bench is under a <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">t</span>ree. Is it bench?</i>\n<br />No, it’s not bench. I spy with my little eye something <b>next to</b> something beginning with <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">B</span>.\n<br /><i>There are leaves next to the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">b</span>in. Is it leaves?</i>\n<br />No, it’s not leaves. I spy with my little eye something <b>beside</b> something beginning with <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">P</span>.\n<br /><i>There is grass beside the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">p</span>ath. Is it grass?</i>\n<br />Yes, it is grass!</p>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 22, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 37830227, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\"><p style=\"text-align:left\">I spy with my little eye something <b>under</b> something beginning with <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">T</span>.\n<br /><i>The bench is under a <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">t</span>ree. Is it bench?</i>\n<br />No, it’s not bench. I spy with my little eye something <b>next to</b> something beginning with <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">B</span>.\n<br /><i>There are leaves next to the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">b</span>in. Is it leaves?</i>\n<br />No, it’s not leaves. I spy with my little eye something <b>beside</b> something beginning with <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">P</span>.\n<br /><i>There is grass beside the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">p</span>ath. Is it grass?</i>\n<br />Yes, it is grass!</p></span></p>", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 37830670, "text": "Here are some clues you could give for <u>grass</u> if you were in the park in the photo:\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 37830227, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 37830312, "text": "This game is like the ordinary game of I-Spy, but instead of saying <b>what</b> you can see, you say <b>where</b> you can see something. ", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1634640946849_1image1-01FJC3292BW4M9PZRYHY0KANJZ.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 37830227, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 39768936, "text": "The words in <b>bold</b> in the example are called ‘prepositions’. You will need to use one in every clue. Here are some examples (you might know more):\n<ul>\n<li>In</li>\n<li>Beside</li>\n<li>Under\t</li>\n<li>Behind</li>\n<li>On</li>\n<li>Above</li>\n<li>Below\t</li>\n<li>Opposite</li>\n<li>Next to</li>\n<li>Near</li>\n</ul>\n<br></br>\nDon’t forget, in this version of I Spy, you can use a different letter for every clue. Just choose a new preposition each time!", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 37830227, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]